{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "de0ce46bbb0cdfe8f2bdf7328e41c25ab395ebf56bae5d25c977d78ab18c181c", "ja": "ミリオンお笑いスターズ", "zh": "百万搞笑群星", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9d3980a387b2a0553fed144b9c54e4d284850af9efbf8cad95f1773a8681cef7", "ja": "コメディの演じ方がつかめない琴葉。未来の\nアイディアで漫才をしてみることに。しかし\nウケが悪く、レッスンは行き詰ってしまう。\nそこで風花とプロデューサーからコメディの\n演劇を見てみないかと提案される。", "zh": "琴叶找不到演绎喜剧的方法。她决定根据未来的点子试演漫才。然而反响不佳，训练陷入了僵局。于是风花和制作人提议她去观看喜剧话剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7b13bd7a5fd54bb3a8f379f8d6ceb56ff0c568146c69808592245d647875e8b2", "ja": "（それぞれ、受けたい役をいくつか決めた後、\nオーディションに向けてのレッスンが始まった）", "zh": "（各自决定了几个想出演的角色后，面向试镜的训练开始了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "45f78e712d6a2ca0f92a64b2093a5e9b28a2f4c3f2c3162af66e1b4f0d8eeecf", "ja": "（まずは、事前に渡されたシーンを、\nそれぞれ演じてみているんだけど……）", "zh": "（首先，大家都试着演了一遍事先拿到的场景，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "42f0762bca94f62d21be23fa2d21483baa24fc804b9ce496c1a8c8de766cee51", "ja": "おっはようございまーす！\nすみません、遅刻しました！", "zh": "早上好——！\n对不起，我迟到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "64a6bab053218ee143cf2b6fed7cb688d4e64cec16943b97bc9d87b96f869338", "ja": "刑部（おさかべ）さん！？\nあなた、今何時だと思ってるの！", "zh": "刑部先生！？  \n你知不知道现在几点了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "975a62233cd73e13f71502d418df5654c6cee3d8c360e9f965c949e32186a746", "ja": "すみませ～ん！　来る途中、\n道に迷ってるおばあさんがいたので、案内してて……。", "zh": "对不起～！过来的路上遇到一位迷路的老奶奶，所以我带她找路来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "94f177cb9fbcb6935fe3c7dc99c23a1dd6cb320314cece324e5a780c58a0558e", "ja": "はぁ……仕方ないわね。仕事はチーフに聞いて。\n私、いま手が離せないから。", "zh": "哈啊……真拿你没办法。工作的事去问组长。\n我现在走不开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "e1041afc481123b2e63ba99ecd961b03704161f05aa45a9ef64d5545b098f71c", "ja": "だったら私、貴島（きじま）先輩のお手伝いします！\nひとりより、ふたりのほうが早いですから♪", "zh": "那样的话，我来帮贵岛前辈吧！比起一个人，两个人一起更快嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "01dcf2c9cd618e5163d527a187aa35f3a25bbd8eeea7ccb2595964f801cb84b8", "ja": "だ、大丈夫よ！\n私はほら、ひとりのほうが、はかどるタイプだから！", "zh": "没、没关系！\n我啊，毕竟是一个人反而效率更高的类型！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "1ac188624e915a6cf0046e5de243b68950ad89e21498217c85d7463369c0fd20", "ja": "そんな、遠慮なんてしないでくださいよ～。\nなんでもしますので、言ってください！", "zh": "别这么见外嘛～  \n我什么都愿意做，所以请尽管吩咐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "39b94dc40bea26755dc29870b5b1992b2aa6a0ab6a585c2b92d7cfd3d28d471f", "ja": "あっ！　そうだ、倉庫の整理をしましょうか！？\nひとりじゃ大変だって、前に言ってましたよね、先輩！", "zh": "啊！对了，要不要去整理仓库！？\n前辈之前说过，一个人弄很辛苦的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "9798086ab92740042f08bef7d9cfaf47de2fe71cb0da54f44eb245c54eaf7ae5", "ja": "それはダメ～！！　……はっ！\nと、とにかく、ひとりで平気だから。それじゃ！", "zh": "那可不行～！！……啊！\n总、总之，我一个人没问题。那就这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "17a25734251784af9836fd63020aa4f0047e4fe7058957bf0ce7412b495a91bc", "ja": "風花さん、どうでした！？\n私、刑事さんに見えましたか！？", "zh": "风花姐姐，怎么样！？\n我看起来像刑警吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cac740017d8da8ce5c6cc879a33dc971446958c8a79cee0e2ab5ad95a5d90e74", "ja": "うん。未来ちゃんらしさが出ていて、\nとっても良かったと思うよ♪", "zh": "嗯，很有未来的风格，\n我觉得特别棒哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "50a73e680035e2b41ee4817fc207bcfca1e5a89e6786c1e4e54d98961202f751", "ja": "えへへ～……あれ？　でもこの役って、本当は刑事さん\nだけど、看護師さんとして病院にいるんですよね……？", "zh": "嘿嘿～……咦？可是这个角色本来是刑警，却是以护士的身份待在医院里的吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7c31caf68fd32553b5267f0ba840ce781fba1bb0c0300e4f7a24c3c297be7c85", "ja": "潜入捜査中って設定だからな。刑事さんというより、\n新人看護師さんって感じでいいと思う。", "zh": "因为设定是在执行卧底调查嘛。与其说是刑警，不如说更像一名新来的护士。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "10aa06ad64d0020b0570f804ad7aae0dc821039f9ebd2d8a306916c7f0d77a60", "ja": "そうですね。明るいイメージで、\nピッタリだと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "是啊。整体形象很阳光，我觉得非常合适……不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "1e6bea59e543a008c103a816e71eb2e4292257908cc3b6b90d73a1bf335d43a0", "ja": "す、すみません……。\n私のお芝居、なんだか不自然でしたよね……。", "zh": "对、对不起……我的表演，总觉得有点不自然吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "763832dd795f0f7be75f888e7043680a0b11803489498e6394c6a920eaafd564", "ja": "そうですね……なんだか、\n琴葉さんらしくない感じがしました。", "zh": "是啊……总觉得，感觉不太像琴叶呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f487f6d7082fbdb0938041884a0938127809b8a03bc2fd61e64791d25fc27b89", "ja": "そうだな……\nコメディを意識しすぎて、硬くなってるのかな。", "zh": "是啊……\n是不是太过在意喜剧效果，反而变得拘谨了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "ce4aeee9337f323ae8cb9ade100815c589428abe18ae8891c8d5c105010cb501", "ja": "やっぱり……。経験が少ないので、コメディの名作と\n言われるものを、いろいろ見てきたんですけど。", "zh": "果然是这样啊……因为我没什么经验，所以去看了很多\n被称为喜剧名作的作品，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "838e08066f1970d58f1e7a921e781c516165e224d43d9e6beb129e81e87f1019", "ja": "お芝居で笑わせるって、どういうことなんだろう？\nって、逆に考え込んでしまって……。", "zh": "反而开始苦恼起来……到底要怎样通过演戏逗笑大家呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "ac344ceec64be1f302c2f195915260940d6b94150d9564ec06087436839b9178", "ja": "難しいですよね……私も全然自信がありません。\nお笑いとか、もっと研究したほうがいいのかな？", "zh": "很难呢……我也完全没有自信。是不是应该再多研究一下搞笑之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "15157d372c65b7474fd8edda0c9d9897d375b2041dc2ea298da2f0732aa37a77", "ja": "じゃあ、やってみよっか。\nお笑いのレッスン！", "zh": "那就试试看吧。\n搞笑课程！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "0de2f345caa56906189c0c9d8543fa8e0764012f2b915aa588ea823ca71672a6", "ja": "お笑いのレッスンって……\nいったい、何をするつもり？", "zh": "搞笑课程……  \n到底打算做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "abbfb893b18b989a3d59f12b41930fa4035e2dbb71fc690918f442ac6cc2f956", "ja": "うーん……\nたとえばだけど、漫才とか！？", "zh": "嗯……\n比如说，相声之类的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "00558e99517d6bd56b67df6a55b1811d651dee99dbb0d93864fc4cd5482f0135", "ja": "なるほど……。\nわかった、やってみよう！", "zh": "原来如此……\n明白了，我来试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "f51690f7cb8cb77aaffd68ee83cd9b5a5091ac13ef79dd05ef5ac72bc14368ca", "ja": "……{$P$}さん、\n止めなくていいんですか？", "zh": "……{$P$}先生，\n不去阻止真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "9fa79c076aa2032f404b17ea9d41ae5e71d8a220da78015ea47316ec0f4837a1", "ja": "と、とりあえず様子を見よう……。\n何か発見があるかもしれないし。", "zh": "先、先看看情况吧……\n说不定会有什么发现呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7e1679fcfa8b0fbca105592984e20e5dfed9128b1e4411c116b9cb1f5ca8e475", "ja": "そ、そうですよね！\n何か、あるかもしれませんし……！", "zh": "对、对啊！\n说不定会有什么发现……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1032_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1033_017kth", "source_sha256": "4fc2872345b0e4f45ae9810e80dfee42dc696499ddce6c8889ad48192873f548", "ja": "どうもー、『ことみら』です～！", "zh": "大家好～，我们是“琴未来”～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1034_014mir", "source_sha256": "4fc2872345b0e4f45ae9810e80dfee42dc696499ddce6c8889ad48192873f548", "ja": "どうもー、『ことみら』です～！", "zh": "大家好～，我们是“琴未来”～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "b239d8db22bcbfbb8902590b5cfa68bbe61d29769be4c292709064f2d8b90687", "ja": "本日は、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "今天还请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "bd03db97133b7d43deb55b6d4f41b4b6823c60766ac0f31b1e803c06375c8768", "ja": "ねえねえ、琴葉ちゃん！\n私、アイドルになりたいんだ～。", "zh": "喂喂，琴叶！\n我想成为偶像～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1037_017kth", "source_sha256": "064db0156ee8d736047573522fbf947df05a580bd61825caded500e60f4a9533", "ja": "どうしたの、急に。\nまあたしかに、華やかな仕事だもんね。", "zh": "怎么了，突然这么说。\n不过话说回来，偶像确实是份光鲜亮丽的工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1038_014mir", "source_sha256": "716d8c1eacd125a6eb732f1269eed940bceb5858e8ecff6464916e3ab7ffa220", "ja": "試しにちょっとやってみるから、琴葉ちゃんは、\n私のプロデューサーになってくれる？", "zh": "我想试试，所以，小琴叶，你能来当我的制作人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1039_017kth", "source_sha256": "071ddb30873979c91e329928f613c9f33af3e8f245f9a8be2384f10d7956d299", "ja": "えっ、試しに？　わ、わかった、やってみるね！\nえっと、プロデューサー……コホン。", "zh": "咦，试试看？好、好吧，我试试！\n那个，制作人……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1040_017kth", "source_sha256": "012e82ff54e8a83dee14d7414462339d7bae12f11ab3a5decfa2d1f2030d10fa", "ja": "未来！　次の仕事は、ライブだぞ！", "zh": "未来！下一个工作是演唱会哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "ae609b96c96f71eaa8e976558007ac868a466cf8290e142af434842c6d179e1d", "ja": "本当ですか！？　やったー！\nツッコミのレッスン、がんばりますね♪", "zh": "真的吗！？太好了！\n我会努力练习吐槽的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1042_017kth", "source_sha256": "4589ab7430ad80c46a42f3a116db9c389f04ebb2e09028c9d812bbfee25a8bd6", "ja": "いや、お笑いのライブじゃないから！\nそれに未来は、ボケ担当でしょ！", "zh": "不对，又不是搞笑演出！\n而且未来你应该是负责装傻的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1044_p", "source_sha256": "31cf03477c035eb628d7c2f9c79fe6f8b9960b2f774e1dfedcf22f320b461ade", "ja": "（その後もふたりの漫才は続いたが、\nメンバーから笑いが起こる事はなかった……）", "zh": "（之后两人的漫才还在继续，\n但成员们始终没有笑出来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1045_014mir", "source_sha256": "4f4f24ed8711f50e681e768fb606c8adb2d7bf96f79f8efd58f930c0004c46ae", "ja": "あれ～？　なんか反応いまいちだったね。\n自信あったのになー。", "zh": "咦～？感觉大家的反应不太热烈呢。\n明明还挺有自信的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1046_017kth", "source_sha256": "4148de98eff60f41ed07ec5821527d4c3a39e00399e0119495b75b9c7d2f3797", "ja": "やっぱり、素人の考えたネタじゃダメだったのかも……\nごめんね未来。お笑い、もっと研究しなくちゃ……。", "zh": "果然，外行人想出来的段子还是不行吗……\n对不起啊，未来。我必须得更深入地研究一下搞笑才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1047_014mir", "source_sha256": "f7922fad61470b35144ce74c3b4320387e55aedb6d796427dd85f12c4cb3c086", "ja": "そんなことないよ、面白かったよ琴葉ちゃん！\nでも次は、もっともーっと笑わせようね！", "zh": "才不是那样呢，很有趣哦，琴叶！\n不过下次要让大家笑得更多更多哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1048_026yur", "source_sha256": "4316741242cd49f99ec237b6434e16ca96ff917b5b4d60d256a3ded6bc690ca5", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待って未来！\nなんだか、いろいろ違う方向に進んでる気が……！", "zh": "等、等一下，未来！\n总觉得事情好像朝着各种奇怪的方向发展了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1049_033sih", "source_sha256": "b63589a4f02f758254c0b7f4ccf22a38ae43204f8e64876fc1ca38d2d9cacf77", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nなんとか言ってください。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n请你说点什么吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1050_p", "source_sha256": "68ecd11d0ef209faca4c00eaf588fd0867f615fc19ca8caf957bed83a25e0699", "ja": "そ、そうだな……ええと、ちょっといいか？\n実は、みんなを連れて行きたいところがあるんだ。", "zh": "对、对啊……那个，能耽误你一会儿吗？其实，我有个想带大家去的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1051_026yur", "source_sha256": "4281a72cc4086f21e715dee28490ecc15c4c31146cf604521df16517dcc987cb", "ja": "連れて行きたいところ……？", "zh": "想带大家去的地方……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1052_014mir", "source_sha256": "219ae6e9a10876a809fbd56af87d6b6660b2fe86e0ccb0caaea61a8b5295c394", "ja": "わかった！　お笑いライブですね！？", "zh": "我知道了！是搞笑艺人的演出现场对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1053_p", "source_sha256": "56ef56b58ef18a804a17ce1fa1bcc4fd6475e6fff7b2b9a5d275b9e9ebb7fc0e", "ja": "近いけど、ちょっと違うな。\n正解は、演劇だ。", "zh": "虽然接近了，但还是有点不对。正确答案是戏剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1054_p", "source_sha256": "cde157d4732927f9ed365d73ee1b2758adfc432957706fda97bafa461bcc48eb", "ja": "お芝居を研究するために、みんなに\n演劇を見てもらおうかと思って。", "zh": "为了研究戏剧，我想着让大家\n看一场戏剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1055_041fuk", "source_sha256": "86a09ce9cd9c18cbdf6a94fd42aa03130eb9e870b86133567e6280826ea81b3d", "ja": "私から、{$P$}さんに相談したんだ。\nもっと身近に感じる方法がある気がして……。", "zh": "是我主动去找{$P$}先生商量的。\n我感觉应该有什么方法，能让大家对演剧更有亲切感……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1056_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a9ae041b14903354fcdd68546a92e3064a2284bae719aac1ea8941d2f9db93fe", "ja": "百聞は一見に如かずっていうし。コメディのお芝居を、\n生で観てみるのがいいんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "都说百闻不如一见嘛。我觉得，去现场看看喜剧演出比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1057_033sih", "source_sha256": "8330872af9dc5a7c8edc3377053883634ab0e589736c8588a7720648bf9014c5", "ja": "たしかに……オーディション対策なら、\n生の演技を見たほうが勉強になりそうですね。", "zh": "确实……如果是为了准备试镜，\n还是看看现场表演会更有帮助吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1058_017kth", "source_sha256": "c743d312868e1e6be5090934576821f3d2d1775a3ed5dd34ccf55f0b0d849fe7", "ja": "そ、そうですよね……。私ったら、どうして\nそんなことにも気づかなかったんだろう……。", "zh": "是、是啊……我真是的，怎么连这种事都没注意到呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1059_p", "source_sha256": "cc62f883d81e89d1cc9d3ec648af8d3f1730437e945922f42aa3a4b3dcca68e2", "ja": "気持ちが焦っていたんだろうな……。\nお陰で、珍しいものが見られたけど。", "zh": "大概是心里太着急了吧……。\n不过也多亏如此，才能看到稀奇的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1060_014mir", "source_sha256": "a164ad7cde682d38c62b60b47a6827ca8502b38903a8dfa95df3d80707b406e4", "ja": "えへへ……{$P$}さんに\nほめられちゃった！", "zh": "嘿嘿……被{$P$}先生夸奖了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1061_033sih", "source_sha256": "39939edc905c8a0c695de3ba9c1ec0aa13e974889fe33d548fd40b1b4558dfb9", "ja": "ほめてないと思うけど。\n……はぁ、まったく。", "zh": "我觉得我没在夸你吧。\n……唉，真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0316_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_02_1062_p", "source_sha256": "19465edd8e62395a873e8adbf6c084f2383171c44cfc2a906f531b2905299788", "ja": "（あまり参考にならなかったとはいえ、琴葉も未来も\n姿勢は前のめり。きっと、成果に繋がる……はずだ！）", "zh": "（虽然没能提供太多参考，但琴叶和未来的态度都很积极。一定能带来成果……应该吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
